---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPost from '../components/BlogPost.astro';

const title = "Air Force 1 Resale: Competitive Pricing Guide for Resellers";
const description = "Track Nike Air Force 1 prices across Nike.com, Foot Locker, Finish Line, and StockX. Learn how to monitor competitors and maximize your resale margins.";
---

<Layout title={`${title} — Talon`}>
  <BlogPost
    title={title}
    description={description}
    category="Sneakers"
    readTime="5 min read"
    updated="Jan 2026"
  >
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">Air Force 1s are the backbone of sneaker resale — volume is high, margins are tighter, and competition is fierce. Whether you're selling general releases or limited colorways, knowing where your price stands against the market is the difference between a quick sale and a listing that sits for weeks.</p>

      <div class="scenario-strip">
        <div class="sc-item">
          <span class="sc-tag">Scenario 1</span>
          <div class="sc-title">Nike runs clearance</div>
          <div class="sc-impact sc-impact-r">−15% market drop</div>
          <div class="sc-desc">Nike.com drops prices. Resale market adjusts within 24h.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-item">
          <span class="sc-tag">Scenario 2</span>
          <div class="sc-title">Limited colorway drops</div>
          <div class="sc-impact sc-impact-g">+20-40% markup</div>
          <div class="sc-desc">Sells out in minutes. Resale spikes. Early sellers win.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-item">
          <span class="sc-tag">Scenario 3</span>
          <div class="sc-title">You're overpriced</div>
          <div class="sc-impact sc-impact-r">Listing stagnates</div>
          <div class="sc-desc">5% above market. Buyers compare and choose cheaper option.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="platforms">Where Air Force 1 prices come from</h2>
      <p>AF1 pricing spans two worlds — retail and resale:</p>

      <div class="comparison-wrap">
        <table class="comparison-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Platform</th><th>Type</th><th>Price influence</th><th>Volume</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Nike.com</strong></td>
              <td>Retail</td>
              <td>MSRP + sales</td>
              <td>Highest</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Foot Locker</strong></td>
              <td>Retail</td>
              <td>Matches Nike</td>
              <td>High</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>StockX</strong></td>
              <td>Resale</td>
              <td>Market-clearing</td>
              <td>High</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hl">
              <td><strong>All combined</strong></td>
              <td><span class="chk-yes">✓ Full picture</span></td>
              <td><span class="chk-yes">✓ Real market</span></td>
              <td><span class="chk-yes">✓ Know your position</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="patterns">When Air Force 1 prices move</h2>
      <p>Understanding the patterns helps you time your sales:</p>

      <div class="skip-grid">
        <div class="skip-cell">
          <div class="skip-lbl skip-lbl-r">Price drops</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Nike clearance events</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>General release oversupply</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Season transitions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="skip-cell">
          <div class="skip-lbl skip-lbl-g">Price spikes</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Limited colorway sellout</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Celebrity/collaboration</div>
          <div class="skip-item"><span class="skip-arrow">→</span>Discontinued announcement</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="strategy">AF1 resale strategies</h2>

      <div class="who-grid">
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">General releases</span>
          <div class="you-title">Volume play</div>
          <div class="you-desc">Lower margin, higher volume. Quick flips. Focus on being competitive.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">Limited colorways</span>
          <div class="you-title">Hold for spike</div>
          <div class="you-desc">Buy at drop, hold for sellout spike or discontinuation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">Wholesale/Bulk</span>
          <div class="you-title">Margin sensitive</div>
          <div class="you-desc">Small price gaps = big margin impact. Need real-time tracking.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card">
          <span class="who-tag">Smart</span>
          <div class="you-title who-tool-grn">Real-time monitoring</div>
          <div class="you-desc">Know when retail drops. Adjust your resale price immediately.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="monitoring">How to track Air Force 1 prices</h2>
      <ol class="step-list">
        <li><strong>Track YOUR specific pairs</strong> — Not just "AF1." Your specific colorway, size, condition.</li>
        <li><strong>Monitor retail + resale</strong> — Nike.com, Foot Locker, StockX. Both affect your pricing ceiling.</li>
        <li><strong>Set alerts for retail sales</strong> — When Nike drops AF1 prices, resale drops within 24h.</li>
        <li><strong>Check your price vs. market</strong> — If you're more than 5% above the lowest listing, your listing sits.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="callout">
        <p><strong>The AF1 rule:</strong> For general releases, be competitive or don't bother. For limited colorways, speed matters — sell into the spike, not after it.</p>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="speed">Why real-time tracking matters</h2>
      <p>When Nike runs an AF1 clearance, the resale market adjusts within 24 hours. If you're still listing at pre-clearance prices, your listings sit while competitors adjust.</p>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-time">10:00 AM</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">Nike drops AF1 prices 20%</div><div class="tl-sub">Clearance event starts</div></div></div>
        <div class="tl-row tl-bad"><div class="tl-time">10 AM - Next day</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">Manual check: market already adjusted</div><div class="tl-sub">Your listings are now 15% too high</div></div></div>
        <div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-time">Next day</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">You lower prices</div><div class="tl-sub">Lost 24+ hours of listing time</div></div></div>
        <div class="tl-row tl-good"><div class="tl-time">10:01 AM</div><div class="tl-content"><div class="tl-event">Instant alert: Nike clearance</div><div class="tl-sub">"Adjust down 15% — market shifting"</div></div></div>
      </div>

      <hr/>

      <h2 id="takeaway">Final recommendation</h2>
      <p>AF1 resale is competitive. Margins are tighter than Yeezys or Jordans, and the volume is higher. That means price is everything — and the fastest responder wins.</p>
      <p><strong>Real-time monitoring of retail + resale prices</strong> — that's how you stay competitive and protect your margins.</p>

      <div class="article-cta">
        <div class="cta-left">
          <span class="cta-eyebrow">Free — no signup</span>
          <div class="cta-title">Check your AF1 pricing</div>
          <div class="cta-sub">Paste your Air Force 1 listing and a competitor. Get instant gap analysis.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-right">
          <a href="/#tool" class="cta-btn">→ Check now</a>
          <span class="cta-note">No account · No credit card</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div slot="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-cta">
        <span class="sb-title">Check your pricing</span>
        <div class="sb-desc">Paste your AF1 listing and a competitor. Get real-time gap analysis.</div>
        <a href="/#tool" class="sb-btn">→ Check now</a>
        <span class="sb-note">No signup · No credit card</span>
      </div>

      <div class="sidebar-toc">
        <div class="sb-lbl">In this guide</div>
        <ul class="toc-list">
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#platforms"><span class="toc-num">01</span>Where prices come from</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#patterns"><span class="toc-num">02</span>When prices move</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#strategy"><span class="toc-num">03</span>Resale strategies</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#monitoring"><span class="toc-num">04</span>How to track</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#speed"><span class="toc-num">05</span>Why speed matters</a></li>
          <li class="toc-item"><a href="#takeaway"><span class="toc-num">06</span>Recommendation</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="sidebar-related">
        <div class="sb-lbl">Related articles</div>
        <div class="rel-list">
          <div class="rel-item"><span class="rel-cat">Sneakers</span><a href="/yeezy-350-resale-guide" class="rel-title">Yeezy 350 Resale Guide</a></div>
          <div class="rel-item"><span class="rel-cat">Strategy</span><a href="/best-competitor-price-tracking-tools" class="rel-title">Best Price Tracking Tools</a></div>
          <div class="rel-item"><span class="rel-cat">Amazon</span><a href="/amazon-buy-box-strategy" class="rel-title">Amazon Buy Box Strategy</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </BlogPost>
</Layout>

<style>
.prose{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0}
.prose h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:var(--t1);margin:48px 0 16px;line-height:1.25;scroll-margin-top:80px}
.prose p{color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:18px;font-size:var(--body-size);line-height:var(--body-lh)}
.prose strong{color:var(--t1);font-weight:600}
.prose hr{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:40px 0}
.prose ol{list-style:none;counter-reset:steps;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:0}

.lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:24px}

.scenario-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 40px}
.sc-item{background:var(--bg1);padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.sc-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--t3)}
.sc-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--t1);letter-spacing:-0.1px}
.sc-impact{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:4px;width:fit-content;margin-top:2px}
.sc-impact-r{background:var(--red-lo);color:var(--red-txt);border:1px solid var(--red-bd)}
.sc-impact-g{background:var(--grn-lo);color:var(--grn-txt);border:1px solid var(--grn-bd)}
.sc-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--t3);line-height:1.5}

.comparison-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 40px}
.comparison-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
.comparison-table thead tr{background:var(--bg2)}
.comparison-table th{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--t3);padding:12px 18px;text-align:left}
.comparison-table td{padding:13px 18px;color:var(--t2)}
.comparison-table td:first-child{color:var(--t1);font-weight:500}
.hl{background:var(--bg2)}
.chk-yes{color:var(--grn-txt)}

.skip-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;background:var(--border);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:24px 0}
.skip-cell{background:var(--bg2);padding:26px 28px}
.skip-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:14px}
.skip-lbl-r{color:var(--red-txt)}
.skip-lbl-g{color:var(--grn-txt)}
.skip-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:10px}
.skip-arrow{color:var(--t3);flex-shrink:0}

.who-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin:24px 0}
.who-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.who-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
.you-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--t1)}
.you-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5}
.who-tool-grn{color:var(--grn-txt);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px}

.step-list{list-style:none;counter-reset:steps;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding:0;margin:24px 0}
.step-list li{counter-increment:steps;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.6}
.step-list li strong{color:var(--t1);font-weight:600}

.callout{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border-md);border-left:3px solid var(--amb-txt);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px 20px;margin:24px 0}
.callout p{color:var(--t2);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}
.callout strong{color:var(--t1)}

.timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:28px 0}
.tl-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;gap:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tl-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.tl-time{padding:16px 18px;background:var(--bg2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--t3);border-right:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:500}
.tl-content{padding:14px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;background:var(--bg1)}
.tl-event{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--t1)}
.tl-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t3)}
.tl-bad .tl-content{background:var(--red-lo)}
.tl-bad .tl-event{color:var(--red-txt)}
.tl-good .tl-content{background:var(--grn-lo)}
.tl-good .tl-event{color:var(--grn-txt)}

.article-cta{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border-md);border-radius:12px;padding:36px 40px;margin:48px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px}
.cta-left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;flex:1}
.cta-eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.cta-title{font-family:var(--display);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:var(--t1);line-height:1.2}
.cta-sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5}
.cta-right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px}
.cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 24px;background:var(--t1);color:var(--bg0);border:none;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
.cta-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)}

.sidebar-cta{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border-md);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.sb-title{font-family:var(--display);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:var(--t1)}
.sb-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.55}
.sb-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:11px;background:var(--t1);color:var(--bg0);border:none;border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
.sb-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-align:center}

.sidebar-toc{background:var(--bg1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px}
.sb-lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--t3);margin-bottom:14px}
.toc-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.toc-item a{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t3);text-decoration:none;padding:5px 0;line-height:1.45}
.toc-item a:hover{color:var(--t2)}
.toc-num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}

.sidebar-related{background:var(--bg1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px}
.rel-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.rel-item{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.rel-cat{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--t3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
.rel-title{font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);text-decoration:none;display:block;margin-top:4px}
.rel-title:hover{color:var(--t1)}
</style>